index ea1a1a0..7260c30 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,25 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- `v1.FilesService.AddFile`: upload a single file to `POST /files` with just
+  a file name and an `io.Reader`, plus association options such as
+  `WithFileDealID`, `WithFilePersonID`, `WithFileOrgID`, `WithFileProductID`,
+  `WithFileActivityID`, `WithFileLeadID` and `WithFileProjectID`.
+- `pipedrive.WithBodyReplacer`: request option that makes one-shot request
+  bodies (for example streamed multipart uploads built from `os.Open`)
+  replayable. The replacer is invoked for the first send and again before
+  every retry.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- File uploads were never retried on 429 when the multipart body was
+  streamed from a one-shot reader, because the body could not be re-sent.
+  Use `v1.Files.AddFile` (the content is buffered in memory, so uploads
+  replay like every other request) or `pipedrive.WithBodyReplacer` to make
+  streaming uploads retryable.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
